### &version;
### Features
* **default-image:** add runner HEALTHCHECK to the shipped starter Dockerfile ([#27](https://github.com/stanvx/ci-runner-farm/issues/27)) ([ea6c88d](https://github.com/stanvx/ci-runner-farm/commit/ea6c88d0cbb9e8f683610d2c7bd632224fa13367))
