* restart the fleet on Unraid Docker stop/start events ([#11](https://github.com/stanvx/ci-runner-farm/issues/11)) ([6596c41](https://github.com/stanvx/ci-runner-farm/commit/6596c4147ed3423d8a5774c521e819f4d8c81e7b))
* run jobs as non-root by default with GitHub-hosted storage parity ([#5](https://github.com/stanvx/ci-runner-farm/issues/5)) ([159384e](https://github.com/stanvx/ci-runner-farm/commit/159384e4dce37efb739703ed7eb13441f35aa4b1))
* scheduled runner-image auto-update with drain-then-recreate ([#9](https://github.com/stanvx/ci-runner-farm/issues/9)) ([3ddaccc](https://github.com/stanvx/ci-runner-farm/commit/3ddaccc508994871e8a6556e5fc06576499a4507))
